 "text": "Hey, how are you doing? Pop song from the last few years, maybe something from the big dance mix charts. How about I Need You by Tim Berners Lee? Then go for the big band cover by Jools Holland. It's swinging and easy to dance to. Hmm, there are few other good ones. How about Shake Your Head by Tom Jones, or Do You Hear What I Hear by Toto? Then maybe just rent the CD and play one of the dance mixes. Roughly ten pounds for a club night. Is that too much? Then go for one of the mixes with the big band cover of I Need You. It's lovely and easy to dance to.",
